    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "29C61E05FA7863A1",
      "text": "¡Eso, eso! ¡Me alegra ver que te interesa![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0089_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "29C61D05FA7861EE",
      "text": "No hace falta que te hagas [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]ella guay, ¿vale?\\nSé que en el fondo tienes ganas de unirte.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
